@startuml
title EasyBackup 动态架构：选择性恢复流程

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowThickness 1.2
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  ActorBorderColor #16A34A
  ActorBackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "用户" as User
participant "Browser SPA /\nREST API" as API
participant "OperationManager" as Manager
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "RestoreEngine" as Restore
collections "Local / S3\nBlobStore" as Store
participant "Safe Archive /\nDelta Modules" as Engine
participant "目标目录" as Target
participant "EventBus" as Events

User -> API : 选择快照、文件、目标目录与覆盖策略
API -> Manager : start_restore(request)
Manager -> DB : 读取 Snapshot / Task\n创建 queued Operation
Manager -> Restore : asyncio.to_thread(snapshot, request)
Restore -> Restore : 获取 TaskLock + 远端 TTL 租约
Restore -> Store : 下载 manifest.json + commit.json
Restore -> Restore : 校验 Commit、Manifest 与 snapshot/task/chain 身份
Restore -> Restore : 规范化选择路径并阻止越界\n预检 xdelta3 / zstd 与平台路径
Restore -> Restore : 映射最小分卷集合\n区分 normal / delta 文件

loop 每个所选文件
  alt 普通文件或完整大文件
    Restore -> Store : 只读取包含目标文件的分卷
    Store --> Engine : 已压缩 tar 字节流
    Engine -> Engine : 总是校验对象大小与 SHA-256\n安全解包指定成员和写入上限
    Engine -> Engine : request.verify=true 时\n校验文件逻辑 SHA-256
  else Base-relative 差分大文件
    Restore -> Store : 按 Manifest.file_version.base\n读取完整 Base 对象
    Store --> Engine : 校验对象后抽取并校验 Base 文件
    Restore -> Store : 下载该快照唯一 Patch
    Store --> Engine : 校验后的 .vcdiff.zst
    Engine -> Engine : zstd 有界解压\nxdelta3(Base, Patch) → Current
    Engine -> Engine : 无论 verify 取值\n强制校验目标大小与 SHA-256
  end

  Engine -> Target : 写入目标同目录临时文件
  Target -> Target : 按 skip / overwrite / rename\n原子发布并恢复时间与权限
  Restore --> Manager : 文件级进度回调
  Manager -> DB : 更新 Operation
  Manager -> Events : 发布进度
end

Restore --> Manager : completed / failed / cancelled
Manager -> DB : 持久化最终状态
Manager -> Events : 发布最终统计
Events --> API : WebSocket 实时更新
API --> User : REST 返回最终可核验状态

note over Restore,Engine
  RestoreEngine 不查询 file_versions 链。
  差分依赖来自目标 Manifest 内自包含的 Base 定位，
  所以恢复始终为 Base + 当天 Patch → 目标文件，深度恒为 1。
end note

note over Restore,Target
  绝对路径、..、跨目标根目录链接、平台非法名称和冲突路径会被拒绝；
  工具与路径预检通过前不会创建恢复目标目录。
end note

@enduml
